<title>UK: Wolseley first-half pretax profits up 12 pct.</title>
<headline>Wolseley first-half pretax profits up 12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to January 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		14.63		  vs 13.42</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.3		    vs 3.10</p>
<p> Pretax		     124.3		  vs 111.0</p>
<p> Turnover		   2,284.5		vs 2,079.7</p>
<p> Trading profit	   124.8		  vs 113.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast first-half pre-tax profits for building products group Wolseley Plc to come in at between 117 and 122 million stg, and paying an interim dividend of 3.25-3.4p</p>
<p>Full company name - Wolseley Plc</p>
</text>
